OL,3,GNEWSAScientists 'stunned' by children's
OL,4,Alung recovery in ultra low emission
OL,5,Azone
OL,6,
OL,7,FScientists say they have been "stunned"
OL,8,Fby how quickly young children's lungs
OL,9,Fbegan to recover and grow after
OL,10,Fpollution restrictions were brought in
OL,11,Fwhere they lived.
OL,13,FResearchers found that children in
OL,14,FLondon whose lung growth had been
OL,15,Fstunted by pollution showed impressive
OL,16,Fimprovements after the introduction of
OL,17,Fan Ultra Low Emission Zone (Ulez) in
OL,18,F2019 reduced emissions.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
