OL,3,GNEWSAScientists 'stunned' by children's
OL,4,Alung recovery in ultra low emission
OL,5,Azone
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe study followed more than 3,400
OL,8,Fprimary school children in London and
OL,9,FLuton and provides what scientists
OL,10,Fbelieve is the strongest evidence yet
OL,11,Fthat local clean air zones could help
OL,12,Freduce some of the harm caused by
OL,13,Fpollution during childhood.
OL,15,FBut independent researchers caution
OL,16,Fthat other factors must also be
OL,17,Fconsidered.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
